 the pinned upstream commit and vendored-license provenance next to the dashboard source.\n+\n+### Task 2: Command Scaffold\n+\n+**Files:**\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand_group.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand_build.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand_serve.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand_inspect.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand_diff.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand_onboard.go`\n+\n+**Steps:**\n+1. Add the `understand` group and wire bare `entire understand` to build-plus-serve.\n+2. Add subcommands for `build`, `serve`, `inspect`, `diff`, and `onboard`.\n+3. Keep command signatures stable while the backing package is implemented incrementally.\n+\n+### Task 3: Graph And Telemetry Engine\n+\n+**Files:**\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand/graph/*.go`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand/telemetry/*.go`\n+\n+**Steps:**\n+1. Define a UA-compatible graph schema with additive `entire` fields.\n+2. Scan the repo, detect languages, extract imports/symbols, assign layers, and build tours.\n+3. Read checkpoint/session metadata, compute per-file telemetry, co-change edges, hotness, and provenance overlays.\n+4. Write `.entire/graph/knowledge-graph.json` and related metadata files.\n+\n+### Task 4: Embedded Server And APIs\n+\n+**Files:**\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand/server/*.go`\n+\n+**Steps:**\n+1. Embed dashboard `dist/` with `go:embed`.\n+2. Serve the dashboard only on `127.0.0.1` with a constant-time token check.\n+3. Add JSON APIs for graph data, node/file inspection, checkpoint drill-down, and diff impact.\n+4. Open the browser through existing CLI-safe helpers and support foreground plus detached serving.\n+\n+### Task 5: Dashboard Integration\n+\n+**Files:**\n+- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/understand/dashboard/src/**/*`\n+- Create: `cmd/entire/cli/understand/dashboard/dist/**/*`\n+- Modify: `mise.toml`\n+\n+**Steps:**\n+1. Patch the vendored dashboard to load graph data from the local Go server instead of a static JSON file.\n+2. Surface Entire-specific enrichments in the UI from the first screen.\n+3. Build and commit the generated `dist/` bundle.\n+4. Add `dashboard:build`, `dashboard:verify`, and `dashboard:size-check` tasks for reproducibility.\n+\n+### Task 6: Verification And Cleanup\n+\n+**Files:**\n+- Modify: implementation files touched above\n+\n+**Steps:**\n+1. Run focused formatting and compile/build verification for the Go side.\n+2. Run the dashboard build and size checks once the frontend patches are complete.\n+3. Fix any breakages discovered during verification before finishing the branch.\n*** End Patch\n"}}
